(27, NULL, 4, 'The Royal Cherry Duo ', '<p><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"18\">Pre-order&nbsp;</strong><br data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"23\">\r\nDelivery time: <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"52\">25–35 days</strong><br data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"55\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"78\">Imported from China</strong></p><p><strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"78\"><br></strong><b></b></p><p><b>Elevate your accessory game with this high-shine patent leather&nbsp; bag in a rich, deep burgundy. Featuring a sleek crescent silhouette and bold gold-tone hardware, it’s the perfect blend of vintage charm and modern luxury. The eye-catching gloss finish ensures you stand out, whether for a midday brunch or an evening out.</b></p>', 1800.00, NULL, NULL, 3, 'uploads/products/6951a1e69659c.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 21:32:23', '500 gm ', '21×18×6.0 and 12.3×7.1 ', 'Pvc leather , metal and resin ', 'the-royal-cherry-duo'),
(28, NULL, 3, 'Bow keychain ', '<p><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"18\">Pre-order</strong>&nbsp;<br data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"23\">\r\nDelivery time: <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"52\">25–35 days</strong><br data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"55\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"78\">Imported from China</strong><b></b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Add a touch of feminine charm to your everyday essentials with this Bow &amp; Pearl Charm Keychain. Designed to elevate any bag, it features a beautifully structured satin-finish bow, a delicate strand of lustrous pearls, and a vintage-inspired gold-tone medallion.</b></p>', 400.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6951aed04b809.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 22:27:28', '0.024 kg', '10.5×16.5 cm ', 'Fabric, pearl and metal.', 'bow-keychain'),
(29, NULL, 1, 'Iconic Crossbody', '<b>Pre-order</b><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days</b></div><div><b>Imported from china</b></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>Elevate your daily look with this chic, structured handbag. Featuring a sophisticated two-tone Iconic design, the bag combines a crisp ivory monogram flap with a smooth camel-toned body and polished gold-tone hardware.</b></div>', 2100.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6953de555680b.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-30 14:14:45', '0.45kg', '22.5×7.0×14 cm', 'Pu leather ', 'iconic-crossbody'),
(30, NULL, 1, 'Croc- Textured kelly', '<p><b>Pre-order</b>&nbsp;</p><p>Delivery time: <b>25-35&nbsp;days</b></p><p><b>Imported from china&nbsp;</b></p><p><br></p><p><b>Crafted from high-quality synthetic leather, this bag offers a luxurious look and feel. Its compact size makes it ideal for carrying your essentials—phone, keys, and wallet—without being bulky. The bag includes both a sturdy top handle for a hand-carried look and a detachable crossbody strap for hands-free convenience.</b></p>', 1650.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6955071604202.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-31 11:20:54', '0.33 kg', '20×14×6.0cm', 'Pu leather ', 'croc-textured-kelly'),
