(38, NULL, 1, 'The Midnight Gala Crystal & Pearl Embellished Clutch', '<p style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><b>Elevate your evening ensemble with this masterpiece of artisanal craftsmanship. Set against a rich, black satin-finish backdrop, this structured frame bag features a breathtaking constellation of shimmering crystals and delicate seed pearls. The floral-inspired embroidery creates a dimensional, tactile experience that captures the light from every angle.</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><br></span></div>', 2650.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6957628e382cb.jpeg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-02 06:15:42', '0.465kg', '22*8*12', 'polyester', 'the-midnight-gala-crystal-pearl-embellished-clutch'),
(39, NULL, 1, 'The Aurora Mother-of-Pearl Mini Hobo', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><b>The Aurora Bag exudes refined elegance with its iridescent shell embellishments and soft crescent silhouette. Designed to catch the light with every movement, it blends vintage charm with modern sophistication—perfect for elevated everyday style and special occasions.</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><br></span></div>', 3890.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6957805f97850.jpeg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-02 08:22:55', '0.415kg', '17*5*14', 'ABS', 'the-aurora-mother-of-pearl-mini-hobo');
