(43, NULL, 1, 'The Regency Pearl', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><b>An elegant statement piece crafted for timeless occasions. This exquisite mini handbag features delicate floral embroidery on a refined fabric base, enhanced with subtle pearl accents that add a soft, luxurious glow. The pearl-beaded top handle brings a classic charm, while the jewel-inspired clasp adds a sophisticated finishing touch. Perfectly sized for essentials, this bag is ideal for weddings, formal evenings, and special celebrations.</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><br></span></div>', 2450.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6957e229ba181.jpeg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-02 15:20:09', '0.375kg', '21.4*7.4*12', 'polyester (polyester fiber)', 'the-regency-pearl'),
(44, NULL, 1, 'The Laurent saddle ', '<p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Delivery time: 25–35 days</b></p><p><b>Imported from china</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>This elegant crossbody bag features a refined textured finish with rich leather accents, designed for effortless sophistication. Compact, timeless, and perfectly crafted to elevate your everyday look.&nbsp;</b></p>', 1750.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/695ff2dd9c99b.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-08 18:09:33', '0.45 kg', 'L:21cm H:17cm W: 7.0cm', 'Pu leather ', 'the-laurent-saddle'),
(45, NULL, 1, 'Blush Patel Mini', '<p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Delivery time: 25–35 days</b></p><p><b>Imported from china</b></p><p><br></p><p><b>A charming mini crossbody bag designed for everyday elegance.</b></p><div><b>Featuring a soft pastel pink finish with delicate playful prints, this bag adds a sweet yet stylish touch to any outfit. Lightweight, compact, and thoughtfully crafted, it’s perfect for carrying your daily essentials while keeping your look effortlessly chic. Ideal for casual outings, dates, or gifting moments.&nbsp;</b></div><p></p>', 1750.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/695ff6950fd90.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-08 18:25:25', '0.75 kg', 'L:23cm H:14cm W:6.5cm', 'Pu leather ', 'blush-patel-mini'),
(46, NULL, 1, 'Hobo bucket crossbody ', '<p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><p>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></p><p><b>Imported from china.</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>A sleek, structured mini purse crafted from premium PU leather with elegant gold-tone detailing. Perfectly sized for essentials, it adds effortless charm to any look.</b></p>', 1700.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6962ab41b87cf.jpg', 1, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-10 19:40:49', '420gm', '24×17×10cm', 'Pu', 'hobo-bucket-crossbody'),
(47, NULL, 1, 'Textured bucket crossbody', '<b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><br></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><br></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A sleek, textured mini purse crafted from premium PU leather with elegant gold-tone detailing. Perfectly sized for essentials, it adds effortless charm to any look.</b></div><div><br></div>', 1680.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6962ae9315845.jpg', 0, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-10 19:54:59', '310gm', '20×20×14cm', 'Pu', 'textured-bucket-crossbody'),
(48, NULL, 1, 'Elegant barrel bag', '<p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Delivery time: 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Imported from china.</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Elegant barrel handbag , crafted from genuine leather. Featuring sturdy top handles, a detachable strap, and subtle silver-tone details—perfect for everyday essentials with a touch of timeless elegance.</b></p>', 4500.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6962b68f21ce5.jpg', 0, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-10 20:29:03', '500gm', '29×12×16cm', 'Genuine leather', 'elegant-barrel-bag'),
(49, NULL, 1, 'Heritage lock ', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><p>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days</b>&nbsp;</p><p><b>Imported from china.</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>2 SIZES (Mini and Large)&nbsp;</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size:17px\" ;=\"\">20×13.5×7 price 2450 bdt </span><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:17px\" ;=\"\">28×18×10 price 2650 bdt</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:17px\" ;=\"\">&nbsp;</span><!--/data/user/0/com.samsung.android.app.notes/files/clipdata/clipdata_bodytext_260123_181811_591.sdocx--><b></b></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody></tbody></table><p><b>A structured mini purse designed with a refined top handle, secure turn-lock closure, and a clean, timeless silhouette. Features a spacious main compartment to keep essentials organized, sturdy construction for everyday use, and elegant hardware that adds a polished finish. Perfect for both casual outings and dressy occasions.</b><b></b></p>', 2650.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/6973688c816af.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-23 12:24:44', '350-720 gm', '20×13.5×7cm and 28×18×10cm', 'Pu leather ', 'heritage-lock'),
