(81, NULL, 1, 'Lumière Weave Chain Bag', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time:<b> 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A refined flap bag featuring a softly textured woven finish, polished turn-lock closure, and a delicate chain strap. Compact yet elegant—perfect for carrying essentials with effortless charm.</b></div></p>', 1550.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697c8b53023cc.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 10:43:31', '350 gm', '20×13×8 cm', 'Pu leather', 'lumiere-weave-chain-bag'),
(82, NULL, 1, 'The Lattice Quilt Crossbody', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></p><p><b>Imported from china.</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Elevate your ensemble with this sophisticated quilted flap bag, a perfect blend of modern texture and timeless silhouette. Designed for the discerning minimalist, it features a unique chevron-lattice stitching pattern that adds a sculptural depth to its soft-touch finish.</b></p>', 1550.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697cb6b4d335d.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 13:48:36', '350 gm', '18×11×6cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-lattice-quilt-crossbody'),
(83, NULL, 1, 'The Heirloom Baguette', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Defined by its sleek, elongated silhouette and ultra-smooth finish, this shoulder bag is the epitome of quiet luxury. Its minimalist design prioritizes clean lines and high-quality craftsmanship, making it an essential staple for the modern wardrobe.</b></div><p></p>', 1600.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697cbb117ebbb.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 14:07:13', '350 gm', '23×12×6 cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-heirloom-baguette'),
(84, NULL, 2, 'Tweed purse', '<b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time<b>: 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Channel effortless chic with this heritage-inspired accessory, designed to add a touch of tactile luxury to your ensemble. This compact piece pairs the timeless texture of bouclé tweed with a contemporary, asymmetrical flap for a look that is both classic and current.</b></div>', 500.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697cc98f70cd5.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 15:08:46', '290 gm', '12×9.5×2cm', 'Pu leather', 'tweed-purse'),
(85, NULL, 2, 'The Artisan Wallet', '<b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Sophistication meets utility in this structured bi-fold wallet, designed for those who appreciate the finer details. With its classic aesthetic and high-tactile finish, it serves as a foundational accessory for any curated collection.</b></div>', 450.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697ccb1235889.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 15:15:30', '73gm', '11×8.5×4cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-artisan-wallet'),
(86, NULL, 2, 'The Camellia Quilted wallet', '<p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Capture the essence of classic romance with this exquisitely quilted micro-accessory. A tribute to feminine elegance, this piece combines iconic diamond stitching with a delicate floral centerpiece, making it a timeless addition to any collection.</b></div></p>', 350.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697ccc5db28ba.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 15:21:01', '150 gm', '10.5×7.5×3.5cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-camellia-quilted-wallet'),
(87, NULL, 2, 'The Soho Sleek wallet ', '<b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Defined by its sleek, elongated silhouette and polished finish, this shoulder bag is the epitome of quiet luxury. Its minimalist design prioritizes clean lines and high-quality craftsmanship, making it an essential staple for the modern wardrobe.</b></div>', 800.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697ccdc8d95a2.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 15:27:04', '141 gm', '12×10×2.5cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-soho-sleek-wallet'),
(88, NULL, 1, 'The Belle Bow Bowling Bag', '<p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time:<b> 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Embrace a playful yet sophisticated aesthetic with this utilitarian-chic handbag. Perfectly balancing soft curves with structured hardware, this piece is designed for those who love a feminine touch on a high-function silhouette.</b></div></p>', 1850.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697cd175af8be.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 15:42:45', '477gm', '40×20×16cm', 'Polyester', 'the-belle-bow-bowling-bag'),
(89, NULL, 1, 'The Kensington Heritage Satchel', '<b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time:<b> 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Step into a world of timeless refinement with this two-tone structured handbag. Drawing inspiration from archival travel trunks, this piece balances vintage charm with a clean, contemporary silhouette, making it an essential for the polished professional.</b></div>', 1650.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697cd422c2f86.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 15:54:10', '450gm', '25×13×8cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-kensington-heritage-satchel'),
(90, NULL, 1, 'The Kensington Heritage ', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time:<b> 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Step into a world of timeless refinement with this two-tone structured handbag. Drawing inspiration from archival travel trunks, this piece balances vintage charm with a clean, contemporary silhouette, making it an essential for the polished professional.</b></div></p>', 1650.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697cd4ac84e11.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-30 15:56:28', '450gm', '25×13×8cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-kensington-heritage'),
(92, NULL, 1, 'The Élise Convertible Satchel', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A refined 2-in-1 design that seamlessly transforms from elegant handbag to polished backpack. Clean lines, a structured silhouette, and a graceful bow detail make it perfect for days that move from work to weekend—where style and practicality meet effortlessly.</b></div><p></p>', 2400.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697e20483d3e7.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-31 15:30:41', '1.4kg', '14.5×11.4×4.3 inch', 'Vegan leather ', 'the-elise-convertible-satchel'),
(93, NULL, 1, 'The Belle Bow Crossbody', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><div><br></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A refined, structured silhouette finished with a sculpted bow and a graceful flap closure. Delicate hardware and a compact design make it an effortless statement of timeless elegance.</b></div><p></p>', 1600.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697e235c0a669.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-31 15:44:28', '250 gm', '24×11×6 cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-belle-bow-crossbody'),
(95, NULL, 1, 'The Belmont Crossbody', '<p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time:<b> 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A refined, compact crossbody crafted with smooth leather and clean lines. Designed with a structured flap, polished buckle closure, and an adjustable strap for effortless wear—timeless, elegant, and made for everyday sophistication.</b></div></p>', 1650.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697e275633e24.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-31 16:01:26', '460 gm', '25×15×6cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-belmont-crossbody'),
(96, NULL, 1, 'The Belle Arc Mini', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time:<b> 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A refined mini handbag with a sculpted top handle, delicate bow detail, and sleek zip closure. Designed to carry just the essentials, it balances timeless charm with modern structure—perfect for polished days and elegant evenings</b></div></p>', 1800.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697e2980e124d.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-31 16:10:41', '390 gm', '20×15×6cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-belle-arc-mini'),
(97, NULL, 1, 'The Legacy Lock Bag', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A structured leather silhouette with a clean flap front, refined hardware, and a graceful shoulder strap. Timeless, polished, and designed to elevate everyday looks with quiet confidence.</b></div></p>', 1800.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697e2ab0a37bb.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-31 16:15:44', '1kg', '26×19×8cm', 'Pu leather ', 'the-legacy-lock-bag'),
(98, NULL, 1, 'The Signature Lock Bag', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b></p><p><br></p><p>Delivery time:<b> 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></p><p><b>Imported from china.</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>A clean, structured silhouette finished with a refined flap and subtle hardware. Elegant, timeless, and quietly sophisticated.</b></p>', 2200.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697e2bc0e2268.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-31 16:20:16', '460gm ', '20×16×7cm', 'Pu leather ', 'the-signature-lock-bag');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `sku`, `category_id`, `name`, `description`, `price`, `discount_price`, `badge_text`, `stock`, `image`, `is_featured`, `is_new`, `is_sold_out`, `is_preorder`, `is_active`, `sort_order`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `created_at`, `weight`, `size`, `materials`, `slug`) VALUES
(99, NULL, 1, 'The Ribbon Grace Saddle', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>This elegant accessory blends coquettish charm with a structured, timeless silhouette. Designed for the modern romantic, it features a smooth, matte finish accentuated by a prominent architectural bow on the front flap.</b></div></p>', 1600.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697e2d2f11c7f.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-31 16:26:23', '290gm', '23×11×6cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-ribbon-grace-saddle'),
(100, NULL, 1, 'The Radiant Ethereal Flap Bag', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time:<b> 25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Elevate your evening ensemble with this sophisticated shoulder bag, where structured elegance meets whimsical charm. Crafted with a high-shine croc-embossed finish, the piece features a classic rectangular silhouette and a secure fold-over flap.</b></div></p>', 1650.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697f79911c4fe.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-01 16:04:33', '300 gm', '20×13×8cm', 'Pvc Leather ', 'the-radiant-ethereal-flap-bag'),
(101, NULL, 1, 'The Gilded Pebble Saddle Bag', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><br></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Exuding timeless charm with a playful edge, this structured saddle bag is a masterclass in texture and form. The curved silhouette features a rich, pebbled leather finish contrasted by smooth tonal piping for a clean, architectural look.</b></div></p>', 1750.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697f7a74aade8.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-01 16:08:20', '500 gm', '19.5×13×8cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-gilded-pebble-saddle-bag'),
(102, NULL, 1, 'The Crescent Croc-Embossed Satchel', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><br></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><br></div><div><b>textured allure, this saddle-style satchel is designed for the modern minimalist with a flair for detail. Its distinctive curved silhouette is wrapped in a high-definition croc-embossed finish, lending an air of luxury to every ensemble.</b></div></p>', 1670.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697f7b607a03e.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-01 16:12:16', '360gm', '18×15×6cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-crescent-croc-embossed-satchel'),
(103, NULL, 1, 'The Belted High-Shine Bowling Bag', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A chic fusion of retro charm and contemporary edge, this glossy patent-finish bag is designed for the bold minimalist. Its rounded, bowling-style silhouette offers a spacious yet structured frame, perfect for transitioning from daytime errands to evening outings.</b></div></p>', 1800.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697f7d68902ee.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-01 16:20:56', '460 gm', '29×17×11cm', 'Pu leather', 'the-belted-high-shine-bowling-bag'),
(104, NULL, 1, 'Heart Plaid Bag', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order&nbsp;</b><div><b><br></b></div><div>Delivery time: <b>25-35 days&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>Imported from china.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>A charming fusion of classic pattern and romantic detail, this small top-handle bag is a standout piece for any curated wardrobe. The structured body features a traditional plaid textile, elegantly framed by smooth, reinforced corner panels for a balanced, architectural look.</b></div></p>', 1550.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/697f815a4463b.jpg', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-01 16:37:46', '350gm', '23×11×6.5cm', 'Pu leather ', 'heart-plaid-bag'),
(105, NULL, 3, 'Lace Heart keychain ', '<b>Elevate your essentials with our signature heart keychain. This charm blends textures of soft, intricate lace with classic pearl strands, finished with a polished silver heart pendant.</b><div><br></div><div><b>Details</b>: <b>Pearl beading, white lace ribbon, silver-tone heart charm, secure lobster clasp.</b></div><div><b>Perfect for: Handbags, backpacks, or key sets.</b></div>', 250.00, NULL, NULL, 10, 'uploads/products/69a655943cecc.jpg', 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 03:27:18', '0.02 kg ', '7×5 cm ', 'Peal beads, lace ', 'lace-heart-keychain'),
(106, NULL, 2, 'Kawai wallet', '<p><br></p><p><b>Pre-order</b>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><b>Delivery time: </b>25-35 days&nbsp;</p><p><b>Imported from china.</b></p>', 550.00, NULL, NULL, 0, 'uploads/products/69b89ec88f7c2.jpg', 1, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 00:22:32', '200', '11×9×1.5cm', 'Pu leather', 'kawai-wallet');
