(4, 'AYESHA H.', 'My order arrived quickly and the colour matched the photos perfectly. The team was helpful, responsive, and thoughtful throughout.', NULL, 4, 1, 2),
(5, 'NUSRAT J.', 'The material is soft yet structured, and the hardware has a lovely polished finish. I have already received so many compliments.', NULL, 5, 1, 3);
